# Virtual golf league

Phone site for a monthly league. One round per player each week. The month adds those net scores. Mokodile starts at index 17 in B Flight. RonDon starts at index 9 in A Flight. Ten fixed simulated players per flight.

- Page files: `index.html`, `styles.css`, `app.js`. The simulated field and front/back nines live in `app.js`. Do not reshuffle those scores.
- Place is net (gross minus handicap). Ties break by lower gross, then by name. The month ranks by average net among players who posted every elapsed week.
- Index 12 and under is A Flight. Index 13 and over is B Flight. Handicaps are entered on the site, from 0 to 54.
- Par defaults to 72. Any other par shifts every simulated gross by (par − 72).
- Firebase nodes: `players/{id}` (`name`, `handicap`) and `weeks/{monday}` (`courseName`, `par`, `scores`). A Monday date is the week id. Web config is `firebase-config.js`.
- This phone's player id is `localStorage` key `golf-player`.
- Publish from `main` with GitHub Pages: https://mokodile.github.io/virtual-golf-league/
